                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Why surveys mislead</text>\n                    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"200\" width=\"800\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">DIFFUSE, SYNCRETIC</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Same person engages multiple traditions</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Without seeing them as competing</text>\n                    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"460\" width=\"800\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.1)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">WESTERN CATEGORY FAILS</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">\"What religion are you?\"</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"620\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">often gets \"none\" from active practitioners</text>\n                    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"720\" width=\"800\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"780\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE CATEGORY IS THE PROBLEM</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">A lesson from Wilfred Cantwell Smith</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"880\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">in living color</text>\n                </svg>",
                    "caption": "Categories are not neutral"
